    "summary": "Use it in your opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours that the enemy unit targeted with at least 1 attack, plus 1 **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit of yours no more than 6\" from it.\n\nUntil the phase ends, the targeted unit has **[Feel No Pain 4+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)**, which works only against Psychic attacks or **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.",
